  "newUniqueCharacters": 4630,
  "proposedTwoVoiceCharacters": 9260,
  "texts": [
    {
      "text": "Après le repas, nous prenons un café pour continuer la conversation.",
      "textSha256": "95622feaf40cf968b7fb4b51d2f3c938c88e9dc040976fc859b1f9d9f9ff6f00",
      "lessonIds": [
        "core-travel-lunch:30:fr-en"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Camille apporte la carte à la table.",
      "textSha256": "ced9f6ee36ef68ba72455e0ef2b8b2c4933e7f3c433a6a7629e86e07dec156d4",
      "lessonIds": [
        "foundation-travel-lunch:1:fr-en"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Camille demande : Vous voulez plus de soupe ?",
      "textSha256": "fa4600ed580c5c6cc0c483b973bdf94023eed79e6c492797428e665b71b9da6a",
      "lessonIds": [
        "foundation-travel-lunch:8:fr-en"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Camille demande à quelle heure le groupe arrive.",
      "textSha256": "298f4776639a398d902cbb4e3d8373f7a6962f59ab41fc5515b3cf37ac199587",
      "lessonIds": [
        "foundation-travel-lunch:2:fr-en"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Camille dit : Ça fait vingt-cinq euros.",
      "textSha256": "3b3be7ae07d237f6a07d80dab432b4749641f18f7f3c4ffb8f0ef704ca81b7a9",
      "lessonIds": [
        "foundation-travel-lunch:2:fr-en"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Camille dit que la sauce est épicée et que la soupe est chaude.",
      "textSha256": "4069f76583ce05c88707798edb0ebc1e5168ee682c43ab6bf2c5adc94600db8b",
      "lessonIds": [
        "foundation-travel-lunch:3:fr-en"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Camille répond : Bon appétit !",
      "textSha256": "6ac4fa9a39d8b44cf905d324319a600b5c09c26d355f988418913bec7c62a816",
      "lessonIds": [
        "foundation-travel-lunch:1:fr-en"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Camille répond que cette table est libre et que l'autre est occupée.",
      "textSha256": "6ab9d3c417418aecc99986306814c2ac71fb5914a722317be1b32dfa6d7f1c78",
      "lessonIds": [
        "foundation-travel-lunch:3:fr-en"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Camille sert de l'eau froide à la table.",
      "textSha256": "cd723e291164ff1480f30276b301b86629e650a59185ebad1bb50f9c6c7068b4",
      "lessonIds": [
        "foundation-travel-lunch:3:fr-en"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Camille veut la formule économique et Marc préfère le bistrot.",
      "textSha256": "bcacefca3ccbe3bad5a1fcb2c9ab96a10e4ab0ad84af161e7ce1350b929b662d",
      "lessonIds": [
        "master-travel-lunch:10:fr-en"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Ce chariot de nourriture propose du poisson cru.",
      "textSha256": "c5be1bf482e4bbbb4f922c8f79063ebc4fe4b91d4148e453b47601eda2df293e",
      "lessonIds": [
        "master-travel-lunch:8:fr-en"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Cette table pour quatre vous convient ?",
      "textSha256": "c77579073f0fe0b065fed4ee969a7184388bfe164f9e9363427d8fbd2e4291fc",
      "lessonIds": [
        "core-travel-lunch:30:fr-en"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Il ajoute : Je n’ai besoin de rien d’autre.",
      "textSha256": "06c1b198065c5a2454511e0e6910d60096291ee666c457431c3c06a8ebc8afd8",
      "lessonIds": [
        "foundation-travel-lunch:8:fr-en"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Il ajoute une bouteille d'eau et un verre d'eau.",
      "textSha256": "59b98b9942173210371636e7f3ed78730c7addf5fb7ad6dfad9d6153c5036211",
      "lessonIds": [
        "foundation-travel-lunch:2:fr-en"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Il choisit un plat sans porc et sans cacahuètes.",
      "textSha256": "1beb304421efce9a28d97e179a7652110c12cfb6617dbdff2ce323847bbf1e04",
      "lessonIds": [
        "foundation-travel-lunch:8:fr-en"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Il commande deux menus et trois sandwichs.",
      "textSha256": "3666709b1fd54603b8c1fb27f95daa8cd1b51d48e33937775eba3477b04202e5",
      "lessonIds": [
        "foundation-travel-lunch:2:fr-en"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Il demande : Cette table est libre ?",
      "textSha256": "e297d94e386b34a3a5a5e3710dba4b1dc38951048ee085a80bfcfa6bd889e86f",
      "lessonIds": [
        "foundation-travel-lunch:3:fr-en"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Il demande : La carte, s'il vous plaît.",
      "textSha256": "4b543caf29b4a9bca41f2ca919113acb485826a3db8cfa0f6910d27153e62e15",
      "lessonIds": [
        "foundation-travel-lunch:1:fr-en"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Il demande du jus, du café et de l'eau.",
      "textSha256": "f90437635ffe1b3d07570c2fe40c637496330ea86d9748bd1d4e2bf4f4642b1f",
      "lessonIds": [
        "foundation-travel-lunch:1:fr-en"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Il dit : Nous sommes quatre.",
      "textSha256": "eda2b2c0a2331ccd655a80e484d7c4b70bfac655699a0fb67f202f994b90fa86",
      "lessonIds": [
        "foundation-travel-lunch:2:fr-en"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Il dit bonjour à Camille.",
      "textSha256": "fc2bd6359fe3f4cfcb047e8779c61403dc829643e4e42e59068ccbd5136b923b",
      "lessonIds": [
        "foundation-travel-lunch:1:fr-en"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Il dit à Camille : Je ne mange jamais de porc.",
      "textSha256": "6cb6fb28c56197ab0f8871cf91d6fa9a60541ccfa93b85b5a66aa17cfdef19b0",
      "lessonIds": [
        "foundation-travel-lunch:8:fr-en"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Je comprends la formule du midi.",
      "textSha256": "831d6a850863855d5d009d60a788edc195a4b85244096380f71e788d19c9e7b7",
      "lessonIds": [
        "core-travel-lunch:2:fr-en"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Je ne nomme personne dans cet avis en ligne.",
      "textSha256": "6a382f0c0ae7315bbc9d96bda0d7d7114c512360192481297a909a8d1b40090c",
      "lessonIds": [
        "master-travel-lunch:17:fr-en"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "La boulangerie est deux rues plus loin ; elle vend des sandwichs.",
      "textSha256": "e87be6b24741c3d4d5c0b21ecc6f044d75a6a9ac2f41b00a6983835ee24e06b4",
      "lessonIds": [
        "master-travel-lunch:11:fr-en"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "La cuisinière dit que la soupe aux légumes d’aujourd’hui contient du bouillon de poulet.",
      "textSha256": "79c467389444385e7dbf389aa8a445867f141919bde2e26fcf78112e536310ac",
      "lessonIds": [
        "master-travel-lunch:5:fr-en"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "La faim et la fatigue se font sentir après la dernière commande.",
      "textSha256": "8814117982919706cbf52ea8499f2808a2c4007fb00f98bea1b9d30897af960d",
      "lessonIds": [
        "master-travel-lunch:11:fr-en"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "La fraîcheur du poisson grillé mérite une bonne note et plusieurs étoiles.",
      "textSha256": "90b22cf7c1bcfd7ae4f58d36aec2e9543e290fbeebeddff30f243857badf9ca4",
      "lessonIds": [
        "master-travel-lunch:17:fr-en"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "La garniture de cette crêpe salée comprend du fromage et des champignons.",
      "textSha256": "5620e18c92be96f764ea7a3f6c4b54b1d68e8dfe86b273c7333fb284525d1038",
      "lessonIds": [
        "master-travel-lunch:3:fr-en"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "La grand-mère apprécie la quiche, tandis que le cousin passe le pain.",
      "textSha256": "05f59713290202f4ebf3f49829b304238f95d978054e5a1b199d54d9aad7f1c1",
      "lessonIds": [
        "master-travel-lunch:12:fr-en"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Le compromis est la formule économique près d’ici ; nous reviendrons au bistrot demain.",
      "textSha256": "c1d95aa4f77aba4d0600a50f90c1e37133dfed5e00f98fce984f1503b3d71a49",
      "lessonIds": [
        "master-travel-lunch:10:fr-en"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Le fromage rend la texture plus moelleuse.",
      "textSha256": "f41e49e1b56d5e94fbf8a5e7ffc75c02d820dfb1e8bcd5071c4621cea3b58b57",
      "lessonIds": [
        "master-travel-lunch:9:fr-en"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Le geste commercial du personnel améliore le rapport qualité-prix.",
      "textSha256": "1c9ac6a5ee781a307e8b1ac99ec5f39c2315a6c72adce4e57abc78588f3b1345",
      "lessonIds": [
        "master-travel-lunch:17:fr-en"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Le gratin de pommes de terre est un plat à partager pour six personnes.",
      "textSha256": "5ac9ba4014d4fbfbe59f42320e300482ce4885beb64800afc2aed2753f6cb317",
      "lessonIds": [
        "master-travel-lunch:6:fr-en"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Le groupe attend sur un banc à l’ombre.",
      "textSha256": "dd87746ef6ddde5095844edd35661c5a194808541f1cb3f06d8022d4bb08c3cc",
      "lessonIds": [
        "master-travel-lunch:11:fr-en"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Le marché est tout près et il est ouvert.",
      "textSha256": "116ee4b2dc369761ebeee8f38547c10fd602ef9d86bd49c113b1c22d86c6e270",
      "lessonIds": [
        "foundation-travel-lunch:3:fr-en"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Le poulet bien cuit est un plat chaud.",
      "textSha256": "8fa5a5f57f102002eb34acc63c79df4827b7b8ebf0988d66c378a51104835465",
      "lessonIds": [
        "master-travel-lunch:8:fr-en"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Le propriétaire et le guide comparent l’affiche et le reçu.",
      "textSha256": "b351027d172dea1b95caba24d9028c1e193fff20864d91824897d094aa07ade8",
      "lessonIds": [
        "master-travel-lunch:7:fr-en"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Le reçu sert de preuve de paiement, tandis que l’inspectrice vérifie la chaîne du froid.",
      "textSha256": "d00c3ffa2c0222f6ada62a9e194a0e085b63e87a43e2290bd8ed3017874e5e97",
      "lessonIds": [
        "master-travel-lunch:16:fr-en"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Le risque concerne ce poisson cru resté sans réfrigération.",
      "textSha256": "fae6842ccac081db45a8d5ad5e63e81349c0a60266829eb651f99770a28da4d9",
      "lessonIds": [
        "master-travel-lunch:8:fr-en"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Le serveur propose le plat du jour avec une sauce aux cacahuètes.",
      "textSha256": "bfd620098a0ab92dc505ba3bb1cd6af369eb9dc78045d14e0e8c02e3a1f9a2a4",
      "lessonIds": [
        "core-travel-lunch:15:fr-en"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Le serveur répond que oui, la sauce en contient.",
      "textSha256": "e38eaa979d467e10073b4ce4488d45965c72a4183c46b853527fac8d8d3c8574",
      "lessonIds": [
        "core-travel-lunch:15:fr-en"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Le serveur vérifie la commande et apporte la soupe.",
      "textSha256": "fa78e5794f1c7382ee73b49d33189d5527f53169bd01e8cdccef9e718af024d7",
      "lessonIds": [
        "core-travel-lunch:15:fr-en"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Le temps d’attente est de vingt minutes pour le gratin et de dix minutes pour la tarte.",
      "textSha256": "74134b17907edb057d7560e764bd209e352ca8c0560c0a44a6ae4e6575572eb9",
      "lessonIds": [
        "master-travel-lunch:6:fr-en"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Le trajet jusqu’au restaurant est court : cinq minutes à pied.",
      "textSha256": "eef5331bb5b9968cfd685e76560d723a8ff9a9563256c2a7babad9e7a9679f93",
      "lessonIds": [
        "master-travel-lunch:10:fr-en"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Les cacahuètes étaient l’ingrédient non signalé dans la sauce.",
      "textSha256": "41bb55791496f0c0cfab4853ca8f7845339708ca26d3a6cf975a85a6d73b4b61",
      "lessonIds": [
        "master-travel-lunch:14:fr-en"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Les camarades de classe demandent à la propriétaire si un acompte est nécessaire.",
      "textSha256": "8cf8b2017fb7f2f78cd67071e87da57c91cfd231a80a53f6589ae5d5234c3dc4",
      "lessonIds": [
        "master-travel-lunch:19:fr-en"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Les deux repas sans viande restent à confirmer avec la cuisine.",
      "textSha256": "9956675d0cc253211d34b3606e71e339121efe509f4f03a0d3f8e7d468a78b84",
      "lessonIds": [
        "master-travel-lunch:19:fr-en"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Les ingrédients et les allergènes sont indiqués sur la carte.",
      "textSha256": "7db23ead9607dc3bf7de69091236908f875a97904e452912c6de4d6c06bb564a",
      "lessonIds": [
        "master-travel-lunch:4:fr-en"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Les poivrons grillés apportent de la couleur au sandwich.",
      "textSha256": "600f577e77851a8c6c65b85319582af8e379e2765c0450920abdacd4119c8258",
      "lessonIds": [
        "master-travel-lunch:9:fr-en"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Léa demande : La sauce contient des cacahuètes ?",
      "textSha256": "07df8e496e37d55abed8a2494768c99c90690436e3f3230739bf0731f8bab0d6",
      "lessonIds": [
        "core-travel-lunch:15:fr-en"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Léa dit : Je prends le plat du jour sans cette sauce.",
      "textSha256": "f37c30431f01bc7023bcead55f294d310cd1be3b68cb0c9292dd390d938fffc6",
      "lessonIds": [
        "core-travel-lunch:15:fr-en"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "L’achat de ce poisson cru peut attendre.",
      "textSha256": "0418dec836f984ea7cf8cda346ddd9485ecdcfe9d2b636f9db8867480cc88b80",
      "lessonIds": [
        "master-travel-lunch:8:fr-en"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "L’assaisonnement contient un peu trop de sel à mon goût.",
      "textSha256": "0b00da45ef3d5e8927a642385bfb74abc2931e6b03d30d4edad423872771b994",
      "lessonIds": [
        "master-travel-lunch:9:fr-en"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "L’opérateur note la possibilité d’une étincelle près du camion-restaurant.",
      "textSha256": "49c58a8caa133e0e8f5f0bba49e7b9a69ca87bd07c544ed4ba39ad00f733a404",
      "lessonIds": [
        "master-travel-lunch:15:fr-en"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Maya accueille un fournisseur au bistrot.",
      "textSha256": "2b7659ac335e8365cf894fdc38f8e3a3a3e2e40b3a5a01fdae8ade319ecd855a",
      "lessonIds": [
        "core-travel-lunch:26:fr-en"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Maya demande : Vous avez une table pour deux ?",
      "textSha256": "e30414694567c685b5e912968e0101cad21b4fe8ec139a94c0f0a961531d841e",
      "lessonIds": [
        "core-travel-lunch:15:fr-en"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Maya décrit la brûlure sur la paume de la main de Ben et rapporte sa sensation de brûlure.",
      "textSha256": "cc290ce1a8d48c3d232a809c62d5e2fb788fdc595d0de1ca9311136923ec4ac8",
      "lessonIds": [
        "master-travel-lunch:13:fr-en"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Maya et Léa arrivent au bistrot de quartier pour déjeuner.",
      "textSha256": "a1fb52b0600c48be9de77f8d7fa20463807d3965bc0959f437f145e557b86fd8",
      "lessonIds": [
        "core-travel-lunch:15:fr-en"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Maya prend aussi une soupe, mais elle n’arrive pas avec les plats.",
      "textSha256": "b1206af1cb65c8a0ca57752e7bea44b27d920b5567500017b0807e4e6b2ba0d0",
      "lessonIds": [
        "core-travel-lunch:15:fr-en"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Nous avons lu un avis sur le bistrot, mais il est complet aujourd’hui.",
      "textSha256": "b1388cea16efe9d8b8e11eeeb1f2980259bcae4238636057bffc024213ff6b76",
      "lessonIds": [
        "master-travel-lunch:10:fr-en"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Nous demandons si l’acompte change après la nouvelle réservation.",
      "textSha256": "6d5c409797206d57ceb6f78053e116d0ee1e8a8fbe932cee957124dd8f5c0ae1",
      "lessonIds": [
        "master-travel-lunch:18:fr-en"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Nous prenons cette salade et le menu enfant.",
      "textSha256": "afebe0f9d6bf269e5b138c5831b9cb6f266fab3583b3ead2dd8a6cab4a9eca4f",
      "lessonIds": [
        "core-travel-lunch:30:fr-en"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Oui. Je propose une autre salade sans crevettes.",
      "textSha256": "6f2f47822453952f55775d4666b1fd64e88fe6ae2d26967531694451ffabb17c",
      "lessonIds": [
        "core-travel-lunch:30:fr-en"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Owen décide quelles données personnelles il consent à communiquer.",
      "textSha256": "d673bc1b92973393205c2c90954e55b0f6c1645e7d2d182749bb1b994bf3ebd0",
      "lessonIds": [
        "master-travel-lunch:16:fr-en"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Pendant l’appel, je vérifie le numéro de téléphone avant d’envoyer le message WhatsApp.",
      "textSha256": "92dfa842cc512dca3dc2864727ce2c2c45689fa24f93acf1c6673e3abfee05d2",
      "lessonIds": [
        "master-travel-lunch:18:fr-en"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Sam appelle le comptoir à midi.",
      "textSha256": "06cde5befbc3dda7e67f71b321653a8595b216f6479344d4e37b27a42509167b",
      "lessonIds": [
        "foundation-travel-lunch:2:fr-en"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Sam arrive au bistrot pour déjeuner.",
      "textSha256": "521e4789b10f20c6c472e1d5e731ed1ed98bb0503ab467c5704a267b362f5270",
      "lessonIds": [
        "foundation-travel-lunch:8:fr-en"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Sam arrive au comptoir pour déjeuner.",
      "textSha256": "9794069b0b28a9628580788a625f0f52c97115c83cbb554647b1fad66558d6b6",
      "lessonIds": [
        "foundation-travel-lunch:1:fr-en"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Sam cherche une table près du marché.",
      "textSha256": "be991c58fea7b3ce8f3f016505dd6f7bd6a0d604463605b3afccfc431463fc42",
      "lessonIds": [
        "foundation-travel-lunch:3:fr-en"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Sam demande : La sauce est épicée ?",
      "textSha256": "866b9d7e270d1ea90939574229d23d023200e5a6c22c0f82a834bad9214c7d46",
      "lessonIds": [
        "foundation-travel-lunch:3:fr-en"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Sam demande : Ça fait vingt-cinq euros ?",
      "textSha256": "1e78211d2cc765a83e6e87d146c84e3007e39f030601f2069959596abf2392d1",
      "lessonIds": [
        "foundation-travel-lunch:2:fr-en"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Sam demande une sauce moins épicée.",
      "textSha256": "4c8821c84b23833080c54948caf6d95094796eeb8740d54496f3eae9e1ad3c3b",
      "lessonIds": [
        "foundation-travel-lunch:8:fr-en"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Sam dit : Je m'appelle Sam.",
      "textSha256": "0150ee9efd11cbf9c15bbe19b91d244835d58728effde01b1dd7cad8cfddb1ed",
      "lessonIds": [
        "foundation-travel-lunch:1:fr-en"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Sam prend la soupe et dit : C'est délicieux !",
      "textSha256": "35ee09e653da3c7125327ff2bfc32f27baaef0374587dfd8d5ddc81b6c7c3beb",
      "lessonIds": [
        "foundation-travel-lunch:3:fr-en"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Sam répond : Nous arrivons à midi et demi.",
      "textSha256": "2ea49a2a0911903b66e9604f87aeacfee5d27fcdb05238b19f20edb4e9ab6683",
      "lessonIds": [
        "foundation-travel-lunch:2:fr-en"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Sam répond : Pas encore, merci.",
      "textSha256": "254d9bead200d7db1b6de90d0c2e3c8f6f9663d3a12be6055bdafc2eeb1df599",
      "lessonIds": [
        "foundation-travel-lunch:8:fr-en"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Sam voit du riz, du poulet et du pain.",
      "textSha256": "55164faf2bcc45d0ac4675b7fcaf41961117ce67907fedd60df66078a781cd4f",
      "lessonIds": [
        "foundation-travel-lunch:1:fr-en"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Un supplément figure par erreur sur l’addition.",
      "textSha256": "3fb2c9e0aec98f1afedade6e5eb7d595d24488717cdb7d8c001617b4b011701e",
      "lessonIds": [
        "core-travel-lunch:30:fr-en"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Une addition détaillée montre la différence entre les quatre menus commandés et les cinq menus facturés.",
      "textSha256": "9fb79126856b251288dcdbcf45c14da149da17174faa1a8ae1115bb3ae87ceba",
      "lessonIds": [
        "master-travel-lunch:7:fr-en"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Une odeur de gaz peut signaler une fuite de gaz près d’une bonbonne de gaz ou d’un tuyau.",
      "textSha256": "f4101cd190854406fc4a90dd59127e01d95241003a422de0c7de0bf4c12551c0",
      "lessonIds": [
        "master-travel-lunch:15:fr-en"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Une petite modification de l’assaisonnement suffirait.",
      "textSha256": "ca5c3189ecf6a133aa302c37c1720abf566f8138cbc327763cbcb15eb5088bbf",
      "lessonIds": [
        "master-travel-lunch:9:fr-en"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Vous avez raison. Je retire ce supplément.",
      "textSha256": "c6b46f1a0332cc6789a7bf09551c0540c63e4dea60935e0109e7a60d84a09828",
      "lessonIds": [
        "core-travel-lunch:30:fr-en"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Vous voulez la soupe ?",
      "textSha256": "244feb08e726567c78cc62f7936038b0df5ae53cb5789fdd9687c87691515812",
      "lessonIds": [
        "foundation-travel-lunch:4:fr-en"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "À la caisse, il n’y a personne pour le moment.",
      "textSha256": "9717ae0d1ce14024f13553c04a36a30455ef9b9447a65a7802888b35557dfcaa",
      "lessonIds": [
        "foundation-travel-lunch:8:fr-en"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "À la fin, elles demandent l’addition et paient séparément.",
      "textSha256": "53c07c851078daab99bfa394b3fdc7af23db442ede3b8056e99e4ae832c1399b",
      "lessonIds": [
        "core-travel-lunch:15:fr-en"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "À la grand-mère, Maya dit vous ; à son cousin Julien, elle dit tu.",
      "textSha256": "7b49201b2f9811fb4276e57d87350ed71d2cab19369070f9d6d972c0742e1f12",
      "lessonIds": [
        "master-travel-lunch:12:fr-en"
      ]
    }
  ],
  "recordingsBundled": false,
  "textReviewed": false,
  "listeningReviewed": false,
  "registered": false
}
